mg.com/vi/-Giiu6mp0a8/maxresdefault.jpg", "description": "Embark on an exhilarating day tour near Chittagong with our \"Journey into the Hills: Bandarban Adventure Tour.\" Immerse yourself in the breathtaking landscapes of Bandarban, a jewel nestled in the Chittagong Hill Tracts of Bangladesh. This day-long adventure promises an unforgettable experience, combining the thrill of exploration with the natural beauty of the region.\n\nAs you traverse through lush green hills and winding trails, you'll witness panoramic views and discover hidden gems that make Bandarban a true adventurer's paradise. Our guided tour ensures you delve into the heart of the indigenous cultures, offering a glimpse into their traditions, culinary delights, and vibrant ceremonies.\n\nThe Bandarban Adventure Tour caters to all enthusiasts, providing opportunities for trekking, cave exploration, and visits to mesmerizing viewpoints. Whether you seek the serenity of nature or the excitement of outdoor activities, this day tour promises a perfect blend of both, creating lasting memories against the backdrop of Chittagong's stunning hills. Join us for an immersive and thrilling exploration of Bandarban's wonders on this unforgettable adventure.\n#bangladesh \n#JourneyintotheHills\n#bandarbantour\n#besthillspotinbd\n#lowbudgettourinbangladesh\n#onedaytourplaninbd\n#aroundbdtour\n#onedayinbandarban\n#grouptourblog\n#ভ্রমণগাইডবাংলাদেশ\n#বান্দরবাননীলগিরিনীলাচল\n#youtubetravelvloggerbd\n#bangladeshtoptouristsplace\n#tourism\n#mostbeautifultourplace\n#journeyvlog2024\n#bdsolotravel", "channel_id": "UC6b5lTcqP8bcSW99f3uhM8Q", "channel_url": "https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC6b5lTcqP8bcSW99f3uhM8Q", "duration": 228, "view_count": 26, "age_limit": 0, "webpage_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-Giiu6mp0a8", "categories": ["Travel & Events"], "tags": ["Journey into the Hills", "bandarban tour", "best hill spot in bd", "low budget tour in bangladesh", "one day tour plan in bd", "around bd tour", "one day in bandarban", "group tour blog", "ভ্রমণ গাইড বাংলাদেশ", "বান্দরবান নীলগিরি নীলাচল", "youtube travel vlogger bd", "bangladesh top tourists place", "tourism", "most beautiful tour place", "journey vlog 2024", "bd solo travel", "explore beauty bangladesh", "road trip on hill"], "playable_in_embed": true, "live_status": "not_live", "media_type": "video", "_format_sort_fields": ["quality", "res", "fps", "hdr:12", "source", "vcodec", "channels", "acodec", "lang", "proto"], "automatic_captions": {}, "subtitles": {}, "location": "BANDARBAN", "channel": "Dr Mahbubur Rahman Ammar", "channel_follower_count": 24, "uploader": "Dr Mahbubur Rahman Ammar", "uploader_id": "@drmahbuburrahmanammar7016", "uploader_url": "https://www.youtube.com/@drmahbuburrahmanammar7016", "upload_date": "20211227", "timestamp": 1640614724, "availability": "public", "webpage_url_basename": "watch", "webpage_url_domain": "youtube.com", "extractor": "youtube", "extractor_key": "Youtube", "display_id": "-Giiu6mp0a8", "fulltitle": "Journey into the Hills | Bandarban Adventure Tour | | Bangladesh |", "duration_string": "3:48", "is_live": false, "was_live": false, "epoch": 1781109358, "asr": 44100, "format_id": "18", "format_note": "360p", "source_preference": -1, "fps": 30, "audio_channels": 2, "height": 360, "quality": 6.0, "has_drm": false, "tbr": 621.661, "filesize_approx": 17724254, "width": 640, "language_preference": -1, "ext": "mp4", "vcodec": "avc1.42001E", "acodec": "mp4a.40.2", "dynamic_range": "SDR", "url": "https://rr5---sn-vg5obxcq-jb2s.googlevideo.com/videoplayback?expire=1781130963&ei=c5IpaqDgAtWVssUPhMSp6Qg&ip=122.152.50.174&id=o-AHKV_oEVOC6mL0n7yK-Jc79m_9RxUpnDDrRttoq-zW8t&itag=18&source=youtube&requiressl=yes&xpc=EgVo2aDSNQ%3D%3D&cps=185&met=1781109363%2C&mh=p-&mm=31%2C29&mn=sn-vg5obxcq-jb2s%2Csn-n0hhpujvh-q5jz&ms=au%2Crdu&mv=m&mvi=5&pl=24&rms=au%2Cau&initcwndbps=717500&bui=ARmQxEUzjItNa0LLCWaC_bIFjoa_FByvNozAg-Tsn0NFIkgEiEX05na0u3RrdKTYXwDCesSPstMGnD5e&spc=SQ-umis3-B22qzpZ9p_Gwa2GHx10--